   8:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *           + Extended programming operations functions
   9:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   *
