  12:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                    ##### Flash Extension features #####
  13:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  14:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  15:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] Comparing to other previous devices, the FLASH interface for STM32F427xx/437xx and
  16:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        STM32F429xx/439xx devices contains the following additional features
  17:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  18:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Capacity up to 2 Mbyte with dual bank architecture supporting read-while-write
  19:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            capability (RWW)
  20:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) Dual bank memory organization
  21:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (+) PCROP protection for all banks
  22:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  23:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                       ##### How to use this driver #####
  24:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  25:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure and program the FLASH memory
  26:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        of all STM32F427xx/437xx, STM32F429xx/439xx, STM32F469xx/479xx and STM32F446xx
  27:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        devices. It includes
  28:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) FLASH Memory Erase functions:
  29:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Lock and Unlock the FLASH interface using HAL_FLASH_Unlock() and
  30:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****                 HAL_FLASH_Lock() functions
ARM GAS  C:\Users\honor\AppData\Local\Temp\cc8RicJH.s 			page 2


  31:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Erase function: Erase sector, erase all sectors
  32:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) There are two modes of erase :
  33:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Polling Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase()
  34:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****              (+++) Interrupt Mode using HAL_FLASHEx_Erase_IT()
  35:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  36:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Option Bytes Programming functions: Use HAL_FLASHEx_OBProgram() to :
  37:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set/Reset the write protection
  38:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the Read protection Level
  39:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Set the BOR level
  40:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****            (++) Program the user Option Bytes
  41:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****       (#) Advanced Option Bytes Programming functions: Use HAL_FLASHEx_AdvOBProgram() to :
  42:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Extended space (bank 2) erase function
  43:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Full FLASH space (2 Mo) erase (bank 1 and bank 2)
  44:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Dual Boot activation
  45:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) Write protection configuration for bank 2
  46:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****        (++) PCROP protection configuration and control for both banks
  47:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c **** 
  48:frameworks/f407/Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_flash_ex.c ****   @endverbatim
